<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n72168" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀθόν-ιον</span></b> , τό, 
			Dim. of
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀθόνη,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>linen cloth,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Acut.</u>
				7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				104
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				7.3.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				6.599
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				6.23.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Jo.</u>
				19.40
			</span></i>, etc. : pl., <i>linen cloths,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βύσσινα ὀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>OGI</u>
					90.18
				</span></i>
			 (Rosetta, <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Jd.</u>
				14.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Philops.</u>
				34
			</span></i>, etc. ; <i>towels,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				6.203b
			</span></i> ; <i>linen bandages</i> or <i>lint,</i> for wounds,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Off.</u>
				8
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				1176
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>sail-cloth,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
				47.20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				5.89.2
			</span></i> ; so perh. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>PPetr.</u>
				1p.79
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>, pl.).</div>
